lse,"",0.8,false,"",0.8,false,"",0.8,""]},{"id":15,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[900,-290],"size":[889.96875,272.34375],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"STEP 7 - what you want","properties":{},"widgets_values":["**What you want**\n\n**This is the main box - type here.**\n\nDescribe the picture in plain sentences: who, where, the lighting, the mood. Example: *a red-haired woman by a rainy window, soft light, sharp photo*.\n\nMore detail = closer to what you pictured.\n\n**If you picked someone on STEP 2's Face Shelf**, her trigger word is glued onto the front of whatever you type here automatically - you don't need to type it yourself. The two small boxes below this one just do that gluing; you never need to touch them."],"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":4,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[900,30],"size":[889.96875,309.96875],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"value","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"STRING","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[51]}],"title":"STEP 7  -  What you WANT  (type here)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline"},"widgets_values":["hetero, 1girl, 1boy, (sex from behind, doggystyle:1.3), (his hands gripping her waist, his thighs and torso behind her:1.2), (photorealistic photo:1.2), (thirty year old:1.2) Mexican woman on all fours, large almond eyes, (eyes rolled back, mouth open, orgasm expression:1.1), (head turned away, looking down:1.2), (thick translucent drool dripping from her mouth:1.2), slim naked body, (plump firm breasts:1.1), one hand squeezing her own nipple between thumb and forefinger, soft window light, 85mm, natural skin texture, "],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":16,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1900,-290],"size":[759.984375,149.984375],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"STEP 8 - what you don't want","properties":{},"widgets_values":["**What you don't want**\n\nA list of stuff to avoid: blur, extra fingers, watermarks, a cartoon look.\n\nIt's already filled in with good defaults. **Leave it alone** unless the same problem keeps showing up in your pictures - then add a word for it here."],"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":5,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[1900,-80],"size":[759.984375,259.984375],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":21,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":49},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[34]}],"title":"STEP 8  -  What you DON'T want  (leave this)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0"},"widgets_values":["solo, alone, looking at viewer, eye contact, facing camera, 2boys, multiple boys, multiple views, duplicate, clone, extra person, worst quality, low quality, jpeg artifacts, deformed, bad anatomy, disfigured, extra limbs, extra fingers, fused fingers, mutated hands, deformed wrists, extra hands, watermark, text, signature, logo, cartoon, 3d render, doll, plastic skin, multiple limbs"],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":17,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1910,350],"size":[779.984375,209.75],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"STEP 9 - size & how many","properties":{},"widgets_values":["**Size & how many**\n\nShape + how many at once. Default **1216 x 832** (wide, SDXL's native size - steadiest).\n\nPresets: 1216x832 wide - 1024x512 wide letterbox - 832x1216 tall - 1024x1024 square - 1344x768 HD wide\n\n1024x512 is a thinner letterbox but at 512 height bigLust can sometimes double a subject; 1216x832 is the safe default."],"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":6,"type":"EmptyLatentImage","pos":[1920,600],"size":[759.984375,129.984375],"flags":{"pinned":t