n, your picture(s) show here with tick boxes.\n\n- One picture -> **Save Image**.\n- A batch -> tick the ones you want -> **Save Selected Images**.\n\n**Set User Save Folder** (button under Save Image) opens a Windows folder window. Your choice is stored in this workflow, so it sticks when you save the workflow. **Open Folder** shows it in Explorer."],"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":9,"type":"FreedomPreviewPick","pos":[4050,160],"size":[559.484375,699.484375],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":27,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":37},{"localized_name":"filename_prefix","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"save_folder","name":"save_folder","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"save_folder"},"link":null}],"outputs":[],"title":"STEP 12  -  Look, pick, then Save Image","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FreedomPreviewPick","cnr_id":"freedom_folder_inspector"},"widgets_values":["freedom","F:/Apps/freedom_system/REPO_comfyUI/output/freedom",""]},{"id":21,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[4660,-270],"size":[519.484375,267.34375],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"about AUTO-SAVE","properties":{},"widgets_values":["**AUTO-SAVE (this box)**\n\nKeeps a copy of **every** picture in `comfyui/output/freedom_archive/` the moment it's made - your 'never lose anything' pile.\n\nSTEP 9's pick box runs at the same time, no conflict - use it to send only the keepers to your own folder. Delete this box if you don't want the archive.\n\n[**Open the archive folder**](/freedom/save/open_folder?sub=freedom_archive)"],"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":12,"type":"StringConcatenate","pos":[910,480],"size":[879.96875,253.90625],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":23,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"string_a","name":"string_a","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"string_a"},"link":60},{"localized_name":"string_b","name":"string_b","ty